=2 Walkthrough
This quest has several parts and is rather time-consuming.
* Speak with {n:Gaddiux} at the Inventors' Coalition.

:* **Note**:If you are working towards an {i:Idris|Idris (Level 119)|21070}, you will need to complete or quit that weapon to begin working on {p:Epeolatry}. You will lose all materials deposited if you quit, but you will keep your {k:Rusted handbell} key item and can restart it immediately.

::* **__However, after completing any part after completing part 1, before trading your {p:Lexeme Blade} to {n:Runje Desaali} to begin the next part, any part of {q:Saved by the Bell|Saved by the Bell|Saved by the Bell} may be started and finished without having to restart either quest from the beginning.**__

!Updated marked map yorcia weald.jpeg||Yorcia Weald Map
* Obtain a {i:Pickaxe|Pickaxe|605}, you will only need one.

:* This may be easily purchased from {n:Tevigogo} in {z:Western Adoulin} at (D-9) near the Pioneers Coalition.
:* {i:Trailblazing Pickaxe|Trailblazing Pickaxe|6002} also works.

* Head to (I-8) in {z:Yorcia Weald} and examine the ???.

:* From Bivouac #2 head north past the {p:Colonization Reive} and then east into the field of numbing blossoms.

::* There is more than one ??? in this location. If nothing happens, look around for the other ???.

:* There is a bush that may be blocking the path at (H-8). It opens from 21:00 to 03:00 game time.

* When your {k:"Enlightened Endeavor"} key item resonates, trade the {i:Pickaxe|Pickaxe|605} to the ???.

:* You will obtain a {k:Numbing blossom seed} key item.
:* Your {k:"Enlightened Endeavor"} will resonate that something is hidden further down in the earth, continue digging until you obtain {k:Broken rapier hilt} key item.
:* If you are too slow you don't get the Key Item but can try again right away.

* Return to {n:Gaddiux} at the Inventors' Coalition.
* Speak with {n:Runje Desaali} at (J-11) in {z:Eastern Adoulin}. She will begin tracking materials deposited towards {p:Epeolatry}.

=4 Part 1
* Trade 100 High-purity Bayld to {n:Runje Desaali} in {z:Eastern Adoulin} at (J-11).

:* This can be done cumulatively.

* You will receive the {k:Vial of crimson catalyst} key item.
* Speak with {n:Octavien} at (I-8) in {z:Eastern Adoulin} until he talks about the {k:Vial of crimson catalyst}.
* Travel to {z:Rala Waterways} (M-6) from {z:Eastern Adoulin} (F-7) and examine the door behind {n:Yeggha Dolashi}. Select "**Quiescence**" to enter a battlefield.
** Must be on {p:Runefencer} to enter the fight.

>**Quiescence:**
* There is a 15 minute time limit. Your subjob will be removed.
* You will fence against {n:Zurko-Bazurko}.
* Zurko will dual wield swords and have access to normal sword weapon skills as well as {p:Savage Blade} and {p:Chant du Cygne}.
* Casts {s:Protect IV}, {s:Shell V}, and {p:Phalanx} exclusively.
* Frequently parries which will limit your physical damage leaving {p:Swipe} and {p:Lunge} as effective options.
* Zurko-Bazurko will use {p:Lunge} which can do significant damage if no opposing runes are active.

:* Upon completion you will receive the key item {k:"Quiescence"}

* **(Optional)** Return to {n:Octavien} for a short dialogue directing you to the Order of Orvail's maester.
* Speak with {n:Gaddiux} in {z:Western Adoulin} (J-10) for a cutscene with Amchuchu and to receive your base weapon, {p:Lexeme Blade I}.

:* The quest is technically completed after this point, as the quest is moved to the completed log, however this has no bearing on finishing the weapon.

=4 Part 2
* Trade your {p:Lexeme Blade I} to {n:Runje Desaali}
* Then trade her the following:

:* 200 {i:Ghastly Stones|Ghastly Stone|3954}

::* **{c=red:Note:}** {i:Ghastly Stone +1s|Ghastly Stone +1|3955}/{i:+2s|Ghastly Stone +2|3956} do not work for this quest. You can, however, trade them to {n:Ornery Dhole} for **Obsidian Fragments**. In return, you can buy NQ {i:Ghastly Stones|Ghastly Stone|3954} for 50 **Obsidian Fragments** each.

:* 500 {i:High-Purity Bayld}
:* 1 {i:Gabbrath Horn|Gabbrath Horn|3977}
:* 1 {i:Rockfin Fin|Rockfin Fin|3978}
:* 1 {i:Bztavian Wing|Bztavian Wing|3981}

::* You can talk to Runje and peruse the option "View materials. (RUN)" to check your current turn-in progress.

* You will receive {k:Superlative runic ring of deluge}.
* Trade your {p:Lexeme Blade I} to the Runic Overflow at (K-10) in {z:Foret de Hennetiel} (Biv #2) to upgrade to {p:Lexeme Blade II} (DMG:228 PDT II -2%).

=4 Part 3
* Trade your {p:Lexeme Blade II} to {n:Runje Desaali}
* Then trade her the following:

:* 200 {i:Verdigris Stones|Verdigris Stone|4033}

::* **{c=red:Note:}** {i:Verdigris Stone +1s|Verdigris Stone +1|4034}/{i:+2s|Verdigris Stone +2|4035} do not work for this quest. You can, however, trade them to {n:Ornery Dhole} for **Obsidian Fragments**. In return, you can buy NQ {i:Verdigris Stones|Verdigris Stone|4033} for 100 **Obsidian Fragments** each.

:* 2,500 {i:High-Purity Bayld}
:* 1 {i:Yggdreant Root|Yggdreant Root|4015}
:* 1 {i:Waktza Rostrum|Waktza Rostrum|4012}
:* 1 {i:Cehuetzi Claw|Cehuetzi Claw|8752}

::* You can talk to Runje and peruse the option "View materials. (RUN)" to check your current turn-in progress.

* You will receive {k:Superlative runic ring of luster}.
* Trade your {p:Lexeme Blade II} to the Runic Overflow at (I-12) in {z:Marjami Ravine} (Biv #2) to upgrade to {p:Lexeme Blade III} (DMG:231 Enmity+10 PDT II -3%).

=4 Part 4
* Trade your {p:Lexeme Blade III} to {n:Runje Desaali}
* Then trade her the following:

:* 200 {i:Wailing Stones|Wailing Stone|3951}

::* **{c=red:Note:}** {i:Wailing Stone +1s|Wailing Stone +1|3952}/{i:+2s|Wailing Stone +2|3953} do not work for this quest. You can, however, trade them to {n:Ornery Dhole} for **Obsidian Fragments**. In return, you can buy NQ {i:Wailing Stones|Wailing Stone|3951} for 200 **Obsidian Fragments** each.

:* 9,999 {i:High-Purity Bayld}
:* {i:Pristine Yggrete Crystal|Pristine Yggrete Crystal|8797}

::* You can talk to Runje and peruse the option "View materials. (RUN)" to check your current turn-in progress.

* You will receive {k:Superlative runic ring of vision}.
* Trade your {p:Lexeme Blade III} to the Runic Overflow on top of the barrel in {z:Western Adoulin} at (I-10) to obtain your shiny new {p:Epeolatry}.

:* This is right beside the Delve NPC at Inventors Coalition.

=4 Dropped Item
If you have dropped any stage **Lexeme Blade**, you can re-aquire it at the stage that you are at by doing the following:
* Talk to {n:Geosuke}. You might need to talk to him multiple times. Eventually, {n:Runje Desaali} will ask you if you accidentally dropped the weapon.
* Answer Yes
* Trade __(information needed)__1,000,000 Gil to {n:Runje Desaali} and she will craft you a new **Lexeme Blade** at the stage you were at. (Done with {p:Lexeme Blade II}, don't know if all versions cost the same amount of gil).

